OL,3,GNEWSAArrest after suspected stolen car
OL,4,Acrashes on M62
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested after a
OL,7,Fsuspected stolen car crashed during a
OL,8,Fpolice chase, forcing a part of the M62
OL,9,Fto shut.
OL,11,FDrivers faced delays after the
OL,12,Feastbound carriageway in West Yorkshire
OL,13,Fclosed between junction 26, near
OL,14,FCleckheaton, and junction 27, near
OL,15,FBirstall, on Saturday following the
OL,16,Fmulti-vehicle collision, which involved
OL,17,Fpolice tactical unit cars.
OL,19,FGreater Manchester Police (GMP) said it
OL,20,Fresponded to reports of a vehicle theft
OL,21,Fon Wilson Avenue, Swinton, at about
OL,22,F10:30 GMT.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
